          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 4:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Filip 3:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim win gima wineno kwoŋan paka abende atimo gim'aneno kwoŋ Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Boyo wic i kalamo Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afoyo win rupiri ndir je wipoyan aka wiluwo fonji m'amiyo win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To amito wiŋey ni Kristo obedo jatel pa jacwo je, jacwo obedo jatel pa cege, aka Were obedo jatel pa Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, jacwo ma lamo Were kosa tuco mikwenda pa Were m'oboyo wiye meno cayo jatel pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka dhako moro je ma lamo Were kosa tuco mikwenda pa Were ma k'oboyo wiye meno bende cayo jatel pere: Pokirok ongoye kwoŋ go kodi dhako m'oliel wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dhako kiboy wiye, ere woliel woko. To paka obedo giwickwot dhako lielo wiye kosa ŋado ye wiye, go ripo boyo wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.1.26+GEN.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 1:26-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacwo kiripi boyo wiye, rupiri go nyutho cal kodi dwoŋ pa Were. Aka dhako nyutho dwoŋ pa jacwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.18+GEN.2.19+GEN.2.20+GEN.2.21+GEN.2.22+GEN.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 2:18-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato k'ocwey jacwo wok kwoŋ dhako, to dhako ama owok kwoŋ jacwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jacwo k'ocwey ri dhako, to dhako ama ocwey ri jacwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo ro jomalaika ma joneno, dhako ripo bedo gi giboyo wiye ma nyutho nike go nitie i meni pa cwore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'ameno, i kwo mawan i Rwoth, dhako kibedi ma k'othenere kwoŋ jacwo, odoko jacwo bende kibedi ma k'othenere kwoŋ dhako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato paka dhako ocwey wok kwoŋ jacwo, apaka bende jacwo nywole wok kwoŋ dhako; aka gigipiny je wok bongi Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiwegi neni win: Otire ka dhako kwayo Were gi wiye ma k'oboy? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwo ma kisi ndelo won kifonji win ye ni jacwo m'oweyo ye wiye ogaŋere meno won dwokere cen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma to ri dhako meno a bero pere? Ato omiy go ye wiye maboyo no paka giumirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka moro mito piem kwoŋ gime, awaco nyaka ni wangoye gi kite man aluwa, kada i kitipa pa jom'oyeyo Were je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cemo pa Rwoth M'othieno ma gike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I fonji me, adieri akifoy win: Rupiri cokirok mewin medo win raco ayin loyo bero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marapena, awinjo nike nitie pokirok moro i cokirok mewin, to fodi akiyey odoco ni timere ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Aka pokirok no ripo aripa bedo i dier win ŋey jor'adieri jowonenere kamaler.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ka wiromo kanyacel kere wikibin riwin camo Cemo pa Rwoth M'othieno ma gike, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rupiri ka wicemo, dhano je won comere gi cemo pere ma kikur wadi; ma miyo joman kec neko jo kareno joman jotieko rigin madho gimoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wingoye gi pecin mewin ma cemo gi or'iye gir'amadha? Kosa wimito cayo kitipa pa jom'oyeyo Were ayino gi miyo jocandi kumo? Wiyenyo awaci riwin aŋo kwoŋ gime? Onyo afoy win? Be! Ak'otim ameno!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole alimo fonji me wok bongi Rwoth aka abende akelo riwin: Nike Rwoth Yesu, wor m'ocam'iye rigo sereko, okwanyo mugat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ofoyo Were, oturo to waco ni, “Me delkwoŋan, m'omiy win. Tim win gime ma poyan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 24:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.31+JER.31.32+JER.31.33+JER.31.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 31:31-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.6+EXO.24.7+EXO.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 24:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I yo acel, okwanyo agwata munyo cemo m'othieno orumo to waco ni, “Me agwata ma remo paran ma cikirok manyen. Onyo wangi kisi ka wicamo mugat me aka wimadho gima nitie iy'agwata me, meno wituco tho pa Rwoth cuka go odwoki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole cuka Rwoth obin, wibino tuco tho pere wangi ka wicamo mugat me aka wimadho gima nitie iy'agwata me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, ŋat'ocam mugat pa Rwoth kosa omadhi gima nitie iy'agwata pere i kite ma kiripi, meno timo gima kiripi kwoŋ del pa Rwoth kodi remo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhano je ripo kutho kikaŋasa kwo pere mafodi k'ocamo mugat me kosa madho gima nitie iy'agwata me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ŋata camo aka madho gigipiny me ma kinen dwoŋ manitie i del pa Rwoth, meno won ketho banja kwoŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo jomathoth kwoŋ win jotwo aka jongoye gi meni, aka joman jotieko kiri tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedi kutho wakaŋasa kwo mawan di wakidonji i banja gi Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Rwoth thumo riwan banja meno miyo wan gir'acula ma tiro wan, ŋey wokiri wothum riwan banja kanyacel gi ji ma piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, wutmera, ka wicokere kanyacel i dhower pa Rwoth, kuri win jowoti win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro thoth gi kec, go ripo cemo peco aka ŋey ka wiromo kanyacel kite mewin wokiri womiy win donjo i banja gi Were. Kwoŋ wac man, abino cowo k'abino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
